  "description": "Conversion of ground and first floor office space (Use class E) to four studio flats (Use class C3)",
  "epc_number": null,
  "ward": null,
  "last_updated": "2026-11-18T11:20:39.343Z",
  "street_name": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposal, by virtue of being a major scheme at 13 residential units, does not\r\nprovide a minimum of 35% of all gross residential units delivering genuinely\r\naffordable housing. The proposal therefore fails to comply with Policy HO4 of\r\nthe Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposal fails to provide adequate private open amenity space to all four units\r\nproposed, thus failing to create a high standard of living and safeguard the amenity\r\nof existing and future occupiers, contrary to Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021)\r\nand Policy GR1 of Harrow’s Local Plan (2021-2041)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;Insufficient\r\nmarketing information has been submitted to justify the loss of office space\r\nwithin a Metropolitan Centre, contrary to Policy LE1 of Harrow’s Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed conversion, by virtue of its provision of four studio units, would\r\nfail to provide a scheme with a minimum of 35% of all units being family sized\r\ndwellings (three bedrooms or more), as per Policy HO1 of the Local Plan. The\r\nproposal would therefore fail to provide suitably sized residential\r\naccommodation capable of meeting the current housing needs of occupants within\r\nHarrow borough. The principle of the development is therefore contrary to Policy HO1(1) of the\r\nLocal Plan (2021 - 2041)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
